      "cooked": "<p><b><span>Your Local Game Store in Matthews, NC is hosting a Casual Play and Demo night for this great game. All experience levels are welcome. We'll have a teacher and demo game on hand. Experienced players are welcome to bring their game to share with others.</span></b></p><br><p><b><span>If you're in the area, we hope to see you in and playing with us. </span></b></p><p><b><span>Date: 1/30/16</span></b></p><p><b><span>Time: 6:00</span></b></p><p><b><span>Location: 300 E John Street, Ste 110, Matthews, NC 28105 </span></b></p><p><b><span>Website:</span><a href=\"http://www.yourlocalgamestore.com/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><span> </span><span>www.yourlocalgamestore.com</span></a><span> </span></b></p><br><p><b><span>If you buy </span></b><b><span>SoM a</span></b><b><span>nd a second game (such as an expansion), you'll get 30% off the lower priced game.</span></b></p>",
